# Offline Judge 🔥

**`Note :`** DEFAULT ADMIN ACCOUNT & PASSWORD: `admin` & `admin`

**`Steps :` Max 2min To Get Started**

- clone or download this project
- install python then the requirements with PIP, `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- you can add admin by running `admin.py`
- to start the offline judge just run `app.py` or `python app.py` in command line
- login as admin and control everything. `Happy Coding`

### CHECK [FAQ](#faq) FOR FUTURE HELP AND ISSUE FIX

